For example, if the boss is some lunatic the place should be all a mess with elements that reinforce the boss personality.

Also the arena should have some elements to develop the fight like pillars to block attacks , stealth path to surprise the enemy, you name it. Those can be presented as clues and vulnerabilities. Levels can be centered in a Boss when it’s a final level, so the whole level is designed specifically to the final battle.

